{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of mayor in a magical, hanging kingdom in this roguelike deckbuilding. As a mayor who wants to rebuild the kingdom, use cards to grow a sacred tree, construct buildings, gather resources, and shape a thriving settlement. Every decision matters as your town expands and your decks evolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge an altar to summon the blessings of angels but danger is never far. Hostile enemies, wandering disasters, and unpredictable events will challenge your kingdom at every turn. Rally your people, refine your strategies, and build a sanctuary strong enough to survive the trials ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/75340a903309f25542f736f4c9a93ee8.avif?t=1759139467\" width=800 height=127 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/786cd0609ace3b2b07f8178336da5b04.poster.avif?t=1759139467\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/786cd0609ace3b2b07f8178336da5b04.webm?t=1759139467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/786cd0609ace3b2b07f8178336da5b04.mp4?t=1759139467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow from branches, roots, leaves, and flowers even construct buildings on it. You can also build around the tree. All of this customization amplifies your creativity at beautifying your tree kingdom and strategy to achieve goals &amp; defending from threats.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/c437a02b14343f2a61eeb93d11287aa3.avif?t=1759139467\" width=800 height=127 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/4a77a6d358ef20737766043ddd4b296a.poster.avif?t=1759139467\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/4a77a6d358ef20737766043ddd4b296a.webm?t=1759139467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/4a77a6d358ef20737766043ddd4b296a.mp4?t=1759139467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a trader who frequently serves you a variety of cards. This will prevent you from running out of cards and gives you flexibility to change your deck from time to time. Just make sure you\u2019ve got enough gems to buy them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/da4e788cdcd1500da593aef316aac721.avif?t=1759139467\" width=800 height=127 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/0d88554cf4dbba41fe0138cff0ed636c.poster.avif?t=1759139467\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/0d88554cf4dbba41fe0138cff0ed636c.webm?t=1759139467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/0d88554cf4dbba41fe0138cff0ed636c.mp4?t=1759139467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a stable and lively kingdom against all odds. Threats are wandering ahead, each gives bad effect &amp; times to us to prevail. From weather into enemies. Be prepared and always learn from failures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/9c6224d2b1cd262660aa1f3855458803.avif?t=1759139467\" width=800 height=127 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/263d7326f795fbf6ed465e22bfc4e144.poster.avif?t=1759139467\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/263d7326f795fbf6ed465e22bfc4e144.webm?t=1759139467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/263d7326f795fbf6ed465e22bfc4e144.mp4?t=1759139467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Worship the angels once the altars are complete and feel the relief. It fulfills the last piece of the puzzle of what makes a kingdom safe &amp; lively which is their blessing. More angels\u00a0 are found between each run to meet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Features</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Gameplay: Real-time deck building card game combined with roguelite and tower defense elements! Have you ever played anything like that before?</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ engaging cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 in-game unique festivals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >31 surprising random events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 lovely angels each with their own altar offer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/664d1246232fa096cd1e6b429c74dd85.poster.avif?t=1759139467\" width=478 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/664d1246232fa096cd1e6b429c74dd85.webm?t=1759139467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/664d1246232fa096cd1e6b429c74dd85.mp4?t=1759139467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3938990?t=1759139467","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3938990?t=1759139467","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/2ffc58780cf9e676a9e5be3f258306659635ee16/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759139467","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/2ffc58780cf9e676a9e5be3f258306659635ee16/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759139467","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of mayor in a magical, hanging kingdom in this roguelike deckbuilding. As a mayor who wants to rebuild the kingdom, use cards to grow a sacred tree, construct buildings, gather resources, and shape a thriving settlement. Every decision matters as your town expands and your decks evolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge an altar to summon the blessings of angels but danger is never far. Hostile enemies, wandering disasters, and unpredictable events will challenge your kingdom at every turn. Rally your people, refine your strategies, and build a sanctuary strong enough to survive the trials ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/75340a903309f25542f736f4c9a93ee8.avif?t=1759139467\" width=800 height=127 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/786cd0609ace3b2b07f8178336da5b04.poster.avif?t=1759139467\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/786cd0609ace3b2b07f8178336da5b04.webm?t=1759139467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/786cd0609ace3b2b07f8178336da5b04.mp4?t=1759139467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow from branches, roots, leaves, and flowers even construct buildings on it. You can also build around the tree. All of this customization amplifies your creativity at beautifying your tree kingdom and strategy to achieve goals &amp; defending from threats.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/c437a02b14343f2a61eeb93d11287aa3.avif?t=1759139467\" width=800 height=127 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline