s. Be prepared and always learn from failures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/9c6224d2b1cd262660aa1f3855458803.avif?t=1759139467\" width=800 height=127 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/263d7326f795fbf6ed465e22bfc4e144.poster.avif?t=1759139467\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/263d7326f795fbf6ed465e22bfc4e144.webm?t=1759139467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/263d7326f795fbf6ed465e22bfc4e144.mp4?t=1759139467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Worship the angels once the altars are complete and feel the relief. It fulfills the last piece of the puzzle of what makes a kingdom safe &amp; lively which is their blessing. More angels\u00a0 are found between each run to meet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Features</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Gameplay: Real-time deck building card game combined with roguelite and tower defense elements! Have you ever played anything like that before?</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ engaging cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 in-game unique festivals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >31 surprising random events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 lovely angels each with their own altar offer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/664d1246232fa096cd1e6b429c74dd85.poster.avif?t=1759139467\" width=478 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/664d1246232fa096cd1e6b429c74dd85.webm?t=1759139467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/extras/664d1246232fa096cd1e6b429c74dd85.mp4?t=1759139467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","developers":["Web Global Gaming","Bumi Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938990/50236fe641bb75b6292c70c5ae2d9d77358ada5d/header.jpg?t=1759139467","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a9 2025 Web Global Pte. Ltd. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3938990/1457227445/89a9905cd67b435b5f91900e33eac2dae972a795/1759042522/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759139332","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3938990/1457227445/89a9905cd67b435b5f91900e33eac2dae972a795/1759042522/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759139332","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3938990/1457227445/89a9905cd67b435b5f91900e33eac2dae972a795/1759042522/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759139332","id":257207711,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257207711/movie480.mp4?t=1759139332","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257207711/movie_max.mp4?t=1759139332"},"name":"Little Tree Kingdom Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257207711/1b29c4218f48fb54bd8729a39e2395d4ce6f01bf/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759139332","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto